plus/2 [AC].
zero/0.
one/0.
id/1.
senc/2.
sdec/2.
pair/2.
first/1.
rightor/2.
rightand/2.
checksign/2.
sign/2.
pk/1.
zero < one < id < pk < plus < rightor < rightand < first < pair < checksign < sign < senc < sdec.


=== Equational Theory

plus(x,x) = zero.
id(x) = x.
sdec(senc(m,k),k) = m.
first(pair(x,y)) = x.
rightor(x,one) = one.
rightor(x,zero) = x.
rightor(x,x) = x.
rightand(x,one) = x.
rightand(x,zero) = zero.
rightand(x,x) = x.
rightand(rightor(y,x),rightor(x,y)) = rightor(x,y).
rightor(rightand(y,x),rightand(x,y)) = rightand(x,y).
checksign(sign(m, k), pk(k)) = m.